+- [ ] Wheels are built for CPython 3.10 only. The limited API (`abi3`) is
+      deliberately not used because it compiles out `pyo3::buffer`, which the
+      zero-copy image path depends on; supporting more versions means building
+      one wheel per version.
+- [ ] No type stubs (`.pyi`) for the Python module.
+- [ ] Tag ids are hard-coded to the 36h11 family; other families are not
+      wired up even though `TagFamily` is generic over the code table.
