+"""Eye-in-hand robot-arm test bench for the AprilGrid detector.
+
+The same three tests run against a simulator or against real hardware; the
+backend is chosen by the config file, not by the test.
+
+Layout
+------
+``core``      backend-independent: transforms, board geometry, camera model,
+              sampler, bench
+``sim``       renderer, degradations, scene description, teleporting arm
+``drivers``   real hardware (currently a Techman TM arm + eye-in-hand camera)
+``configs``   one YAML per backend
+``tests``     the three tests, plus the transform self-check
+
+Run them through ``run.py``::
+
+    python tools/robotlab/run.py reproducibility --backend sim
+    python tools/robotlab/run.py touch --backend techman
+"""
